  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The feature test moves to games/FeatureTest beside the games, its project importing the repository's build files that the games folder keeps from a game so it builds on the tree's projects, and every script, workflow step, guide and test naming its folder follows it.\nThe four games build on 0.5.174 where nothing names another version, since Swarm's 0.5.0 was never published and resolved only with a warning that a build without warnings fails on, each checked against nuget.org alone.\nA program reads the force a joint held its bodies with over the last step through PhysicsWorld.JointForce, the impulse Bepu kept for the joint's own constraint over the step's length, which a test reads as a hanging box's weight.",
